"historical_business_count":5},{"category":"Dive Bars","historical_business_count":0},{"category":"Nightlife","historical_business_count":5}],"history":[{"business_id":"kdqoDMuvyNedsouc1i33vQ","name":"Araña Taqueria y Cantina","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"_C7QiQQc47AOEv4PE3Kong","name":"Commander's Palace","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"fkfwrIySBnjDtTHRLCbJFg","review_id":"i1ptGFOKNLh15wxhnwDtFQ","date":"2015-09-03T18:30:50","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9323238730430603,"text_excerpt":"This is a divey little neighborhood bar, but it hosts a good crowd. On the night that we were here a few streets in the area were without power, so there were a good number of people enjoying the ac and having a few drinks. The drinks are cheap and thankfully there is a smoking ban in place, so I was able to enjoy my cocktails without worrying about reeking of cigarettes. The bartender was a real character, had a lot of personality and loved to chat. I want to go back and play some tunes on the jukebox- there was a line when I was here and I am anxious to see the kind of music selection they have."},{"business_id":"fkfwrIySBnjDtTHRLCbJFg","review_id":"A04fN1buXJcWtJPnLp0ahQ","date":"2013-11-18T16:15:26","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9273947477340698,"text_excerpt":"Had a few drinks here while waiting for the Second Line, lots of friendly locals. This is a 24-hour bar so we met a couple people who were just leaving the bar at noon lol. Came back another night, sat around and talked to the lively locals, played the jukebox and watched the lively locals get even livelier, very fun! We ended up leaving just after 5am... Cheap drink prices, jukebox, smoking allowed, small sidewalk patio, friendly locals, somewhat safe neighbourhood - this place is definitely A-OK."},{"business_id":"fkfwrIySBnjDtTHRLCbJFg","review_id":"CfJ23nrEj3113UB9f2K8_g","date":"2013-09-26T00:39:39","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9171188473701477,"text_excerpt":"I spent a lot of time at Iggy's back in the day. I just went back, and it hasn't changed. Very, very local bar. The drinks are cheap and strong. They have a pool table, darts, and gaming machines. You'll definitely meet some interesting people. If you are in the neighborhood, stop in for a drink."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"fkfwrIySBnjDtTHRLCbJFg","photo_id":"KtzATIR3xsPvCBCaju_rMg","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/KtzATIR3xsPvCBCaju_rMg.jpg","visual_representativeness":1.0000001192092896}]},"notebook_case":null}
